    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nCurrently the `mini.pick` buffers picker shows the list of current buffers containing the name/path of the file associated with that buffer, However it would be really helpful if it also shows the buffer id of each buffer before their name/path in the picker. \n\n<img width=\"1116\" height=\"526\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01e5eecc-5ec2-4ab9-a5d1-b1d286ba07ad\" />",
