            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\n> However it would be really helpful if it also shows the buffer id of each buffer before their name/path in the picker.\n\nCan you please elaborate on why this would be helpful? Is there a use case that is not possible with unknown buffer's id but known buffer's name?",
