        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "So one example is deleting a buffer from the memory. Right now to do that I have to run :buffers command to get the list of buffers with the buffer id.  Then run :bdelete {buffer_id} to delete that buffer. \n\nIt would be cool if there was keymap to directly delete the buffer from the picker or at least show buffer id.",
            "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:23:54Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/2051#issuecomment-3377144350",
            "id": 3377144350,
